  "content": "\n\n# 斧頭附魔擴展\n\n**此數據包與模組**將武器附魔擴展至斧頭，包含火焰附加、擊退、搶奪、穿刺、密度、破甲與風爆。同時允許在同一把斧頭上混合搭配不同類型的武器附魔。\n\n**‎◾範例：**\n\n![Expanded Axe Enchantings](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/536eda574452a1dbb59d571592f1cae9ecd8817f.jpeg)\n\n![Expanded Axe Enchantings](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c5a47d441e0397864c667cf3b047100f0d3471ef.jpeg)\n\n\n\n## 詳細說明📝\n\n- **斧頭附魔擴展** 完全**相容**於 **1.21 至 1.21.11** 版本\n- **斧頭附魔擴展** 為附魔台新增了新的 **(擴充)** 選項🌐\n- **斧頭附魔擴展** 可與任何 **附魔數據包** 相容\n- **無需**解壓縮已下載的檔案 🗂️\n\n## 更多專案：\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-armor-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TM5K3dNM/ezgif-com-speed-43.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (43)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/expanded-weapon-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bML9W70B/ezgif-com-speed-44.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (44)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-trident-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VcwSJqRJ/Expanded-Trident-Enchants-Logo.jpg\" alt=\"Expanded Trident Enchants Logo\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-mace-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LXv2pS15/Expanded-Mace-Enchants-Logo-2.jpg\" alt=\"Expanded Mace Enchants Logo (2)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-axe-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Fqxsn0qL/ezgif-com-speed-47.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (47)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-bow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VWLkm7bC/ezgif-com-speed-48.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (48)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-crossbow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PzT0xXgD/ezgif-com-speed-49.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (49)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-spear-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tTJBJp9c/ezgif-com-resize-1.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com resize (1)\" border=\"0\"></a>",
